@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@playerId = 0192f28f-5dc0-7d58-bdb2-814ad6a0f4a1
# Substitua pelo id retornado na criação.
@walletId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Readiness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Criar wallet (uma por player e moeda)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{"playerId":"{{playerId}}","initialBalance":{"amount":"100.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### Apostar; repetir esta mesma requisição deve ser replay
POST {{baseUrl}}/wagering/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: provider-demo:bet-1

{"providerId":"provider-demo","externalTransactionId":"bet-1","playerId":"{{playerId}}","walletId":"{{walletId}}","roundId":"round-1","gameId":"game-1","kind":"BET","money":{"amount":"80.00","currency":"BRL"}}

### Consultar resultado
GET {{baseUrl}}/providers/provider-demo/wagering/transactions/bet-1

### Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/ledger?limit=50

### Reconciliação
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallets/{{walletId}}/reconciliation

### Métricas
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics
